		quest.2E7A46639993CCDE.quest_desc: {
			new: [
				"Any world will have secrets &6hidden&r beyond the visible, whether that be tucked &6under the surface&r or in a completely different &6dimension&r."
				""
				"Never overlook something that looks &6out of place&r, you might just discover something new."
				""
				"Confidence is a good thing, but always stay &6geared up&r and &6safe&r; it might save your life one day."
			]
			old: [
				"Every world has secrets hidden beyond the visible, whether underground or in distant dimensions."
				""
				"Sometimes, you don't even need to leave home to find something unusual."
				""
				"The moon can bring special events to the night sky, each changing how you spend the night."
				""
				"&aHarvest Moon"
				"A great time to harvest your crops, with increased drops from eligible crops."
				""
				"&9Blue Moon"
				"A lucky night that grants a Luck effect, making it a great time for fishing and other Luck-based activities like looting."
				""
				"&cBlood Moon"
				"A dangerous night where hostile mobs become far more threatening, and sleeping won't save you."
				""
				"&5Super Moon"
				"A giant moon that makes it easier to find slimes."
				""
				"Some events also have &6Super variants&r, making their effects even stronger."
				""
				"Keep an eye on the moon and the messages announcing each event. You never know when the night might be worth staying awake for."
			]
		}
