		quest.21E1E62AA4761EE2.quest_desc: {
			new: [
				"You might be curious as to what I meant when I mentioned these things, so I'll &6offer&r you a rundown. "
				""
				"If you decide not to take my &6insight&r, I won't take it harshly and will let you &abegin your journey&r. "
				""
				"I wish you luck."
			]
			old: [
				"There is far more to this world than simply gathering resources and building machines."
				""
				"The &eMoon&f can bring strange events to the night sky, from peaceful &aHarvest Moons&f to dangerous &cBlood Moons&f."
				""
				"Food is more than just something to fill your hunger. Eating a &6diverse diet&f can grant powerful benefits, including &cadditional hearts&f and other effects."
				""
				"And if you've made it this far, don't assume you've reached the end."
				""
				"&5Custom bosses&f, &dendgame content&f, and challenges await those willing to push beyond the normal limits."
				""
				"Explore, experiment, and see how far you can take your journey."
			]
		}
		quest.21E1E62AA4761EE2.quest_subtitle: {
